ator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, February to March came in at 54% of normal on the middle of the grids, while April to May came in at 131%. Grid 15431 had its driest year in 2005 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
